


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_bbc2c9c9:


    "阳菜的双手在强烈的感情驱使下不断颤抖，手指嵌入了伦的肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_51c29c56:



    voice "2RI_1305"
    rin "「痛……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_cd30da7e:


    "微弱的悲鸣被狂乱的鼓动声掩盖，无法传到阳菜耳中。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_2eb37589:



    voice "2RI_1306"
    rin "「等等……求求你了，等等……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_49873ffd:



    voice "2HI_1368"
    hina "「哈啊……哈啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_8af9a9f5:



    voice "2RI_1307"
    rin "「停下！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_bc79ff9d:



    voice "2HI_1369"
    hina "「！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_c151ffda:


    "颤抖的伦总算是从喉咙里挤出了声音，让阳菜停止了动作。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_14a551e7:


    "阳菜眼前是伦的食指。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_8e2ab387:


    "伦在无意之间伸出食指做出了这个手势，就像是阳菜对亚瑟做的那样。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_435ead6d:



    voice "2HI_1370"
    hina "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_0a51f6fb:


    "食指上的创可贴让阳菜回过神来，她瞳孔中的兽性渐渐消失。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_2649ee0f:


    hina_rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_1bcf9088:



    voice "2HI_1372"
    hina "「对……不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_862a7e1d:


    "阳菜开口打破了两人之间长久的沉默。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_c5648304:



    voice "2RI_1309"
    rin "「啊，没有……我才是，抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_8559556e:


    "这次轮到阳菜要哭出来了。伦没敢直视她，再次错开视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_30b45f86:



    voice "2RI_1310"
    rin "「那个，你看，下次再在房间做吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_e02cf67c:



    voice "2HI_1373"
    hina "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_83c5e7c9:


    "两个人低着头，站起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_0213aa33:



    voice "2RI_1311"
    rin "「……呜、哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_3b38cfab:


    "伦比阳菜后起身，但由于膝盖还在打哆嗦，她赶紧靠身后的黑板支撑住。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_37b40e1f:



    voice "2HI_1374"
    hina "「这个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_b4fa1ce2:


    "在伦踉跄起身的时候，阳菜捡起了掉落的项圈，递给伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_c1e82d86:



    voice "2RI_1312"
    rin "「……要戴吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_3e5323e4:



    voice "2HI_1375"
    hina "「伦来决定吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_3b8a2a9d:


    "伦犹豫半晌，还是把它收回了口袋。而阳菜只是在一边安静地看着。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_2a700aa9:



    voice "2RI_1313"
    rin "「那……回去吧？浅生她们还在等着呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_01_21b12c26:



    voice "2HI_1376"
    hina "「……嗯」"
